@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_MARKCNG_K11
;このままだと地の文が表示されません
;地の文を表示したい方は、下記のコメントアウトを削除して下さい

SIF FLAG:70 && !MAXBASE:TARGET:TSP
	RETURN 0
	
SIF FLAG:口上色
	TRYCALLFORM M_KOJO_COLOR_K{NO:TARGET}
	
;added, expanded from various games
;苦痛刻印
IF TFLAG:22 == 1
	PRINTFORMW 「...You know.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Can you be just a little more... gentle with me?」
	PRINTFORMW 「You've been kind of... scary lately%K11_ZE()%.」
ELSEIF TFLAG:22 == 2
	PRINTFORMW 「...Why are you doing this to me?」
	PRINTFORMW 「Pain is... not something I can handle%K11_ZE("daze")%.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I'm begging you... go back to your gentle self, please...!」
ELSEIF TFLAG:22 == 3
	PRINTFORMW 「Uughh... As sturdy as I am, even I have my limits%K11_ZE("daze")%. I just can't take this pain anymore!」
	PRINTFORMDW Marisa hugs herself, trembling all over as she keeps an eye on you.
	PRINTFORMDW Holding the sore spot with an anxious face, Marisa wipes the tears from the corners of her eyes. 
	PRINTFORMW 「N-No more... Stop this madness already...」
	PRINTFORMW 「I don't want to be in pain... Anything but that...! Sob, sniffle...!」
	PRINTFORMDW She looks nothing like her usual vivacious self, frightened to her core like a small animal...
ENDIF

