;快楽刻印
IF TFLAG:23 == 1
	PRINTFORMW 「W-Whoa, what the heck... I've never felt like this...」
	PRINTFORMW 「From both places at one... this is nuts. I'm kinda scared%K11_ZE()%...」
ELSEIF TFLAG:23 == 2
	PRINTFORMW 「Once you get to know this pleasure, you can't get enough of it... Things might get ugly from now on.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I ain't so sure I'm gonna be able to take this forever anymore%K11_ZE(,1)%, to be completely honest.」
ELSEIF TFLAG:23 == 3
	PRINTFORMW 「I... I might not be able to go on without you anymore...」
	PRINTFORMW 「You'll take responsibility for what you've done to me, won'tcha?」
ENDIF

