;反発刻印
IF TFLAG:21
	PRINTFORMDL Marisa looks slightly at the side, with her lips partly open.
	PRINTFORMDW You're not sure what that expression is supposed to convey, but it looks unnerving...
ENDIF
IF TFLAG:21 == -1
	PRINTFORMW 「Alright-alright, I get it%K11_ZE()%.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Man, I didn't think you'd be so quick to apologize, though.」
	PRINTFORMW 「This is so unfair, I can't even get mad at you if you're gonna pull this stunt on me... Oh well.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Yeah, I forgive you, so c'mon, get up! Can't let your knees get dirty, can we now, eh %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
	PRINTFORMDW Marisa chuckles to herself as she helps you up, all that anger seemingly disappearing as if it had never been there in the first place.
ENDIF
IF TFLAG:21 == 1
	PRINTFORMW 「Look %CALLNAME:MASTER%, you should act more considerate of me... Don't just single me out, I'm begging you here.」
ELSEIF TFLAG:21 == 2
	PRINTFORMW 「You seriously underestimating *me*, thinking I'm just some naive little girl?」
	PRINTFORMW 「There's a chance you might get hurt if you overdo it%K11_ZE()%.」
ELSEIF TFLAG:21 == 3
	IF TALENT:恋慕
		PRINTFORMW 「Sob... Why... Why are you being so cruel to me...! Uuuuhh...」
